@startuml F5.11-D04-confirmar-entrega
title F5.11-D04 — Confirmar entrega física do diploma
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "GraduationController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Sec -> WebApp: Confirmar entrega
WebApp -> Jwt: PATCH /diplomas/{id}/confirm-delivery
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: UPDATE ENTREGUE\n+ audit_log
Postgres --> Ctrl: OK (COMMIT)
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Sec: situação ENTREGUE

@enduml
